+         * eight-byte NOP at the top of the function. One marker family covers
+         * all of them, so this is a single check rather than 37.
+         *
+         * GATED, and it was not. getAlternate() is called for every branch and
+         * call target the dynarec translates, on every thread. This block used
+         * to run unconditionally -- unlike the two above it, which test their
